WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:01.920
Oh, my friend!

00:01.923 --> 00:04.440
This is a victory for us!

00:04.500 --> 00:07.600
Our fame starts here!

00:07.640 --> 00:08.700
Oh, my friend!

00:08.701 --> 00:13.900
Let us celebrate this victory for the next battle!

00:28.540 --> 00:34.079
"I died for naught"
I won't let it end like that for you

00:34.080 --> 00:39.339
until I am the last one standing

00:39.340 --> 00:42.319
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

00:42.320 --> 00:45.359
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

00:45.360 --> 00:48.999
In our hands we hold blades of glory

00:49.000 --> 00:51.279
and sing in the name of victory

00:51.280 --> 00:55.920
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

00:57.240 --> 01:03.360
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

01:03.380 --> 01:07.900
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

01:09.480 --> 01:11.800
and soar through the sky

01:11.860 --> 01:16.060
with our wings of freedom

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
What Needs to Be Done Now: Eve of the Counterattack, Part 3

01:40.470 --> 01:43.049
When did you last change shafts?

01:43.050 --> 01:44.309
Six days ago.

01:44.310 --> 01:45.660
After the clean-up operation.

01:46.700 --> 01:48.499
That matches the records.

01:48.500 --> 01:49.549
Okay, next.

01:49.550 --> 01:50.170
You are?

01:50.520 --> 01:53.550
Krista Lenz, Squad 42.

01:53.900 --> 01:55.969
Check it for wear.

01:55.970 --> 01:59.859
Who'd have thought killing Titans
was a punishable offense...

01:59.860 --> 02:02.739
It does seem ironic, but those
two were valuable test subjects.

02:02.740 --> 02:07.009
Even so, why are they looking for
the culprit among us trainees?

02:07.010 --> 02:09.919
We just finished cleaning
up the battlefield today.

02:09.920 --> 02:11.570
Everyone's totally beat.

02:13.440 --> 02:16.469
The culprit must've really loathed the Titans.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.330
Yeah.

02:17.331 --> 02:21.419
But in reality, they ended
up helping the Titans...

02:21.420 --> 02:24.779
They may have fulfilled their
personal desire for vengeance,

02:24.780 --> 02:27.010
but the net result is a
major setback for humanity.

02:27.460 --> 02:31.219
I think I get why they did it,
because I can be an idiot myself...

02:31.220 --> 02:33.049
Before I'd ever seen a Titan,

02:33.050 --> 02:36.110
I was certain I wanted
to join the Recon Corps.

02:37.120 --> 02:39.080
But now, I never want to see another.

02:39.760 --> 02:42.880
And today, we all have to
decide which force to join.

02:50.440 --> 02:53.380
Even Jean's seriously...

03:07.080 --> 03:09.900
Everyone's regretting it.

03:10.830 --> 03:13.359
If I'd known it'd be this hellish,

03:13.360 --> 03:15.250
I'd have never chosen to be a soldier.

03:16.250 --> 03:18.959
Now I'm so exhausted,

03:18.960 --> 03:20.930
I can't think of anything else...

03:31.180 --> 03:32.560
Hey, Marco...

03:33.230 --> 03:36.610
I can't even tell which
are your bones anymore.

03:42.440 --> 03:45.159
If I hadn't become a soldier,

03:45.160 --> 03:48.360
I wouldn't have to keep wondering
who'll be on that pile next.

03:50.660 --> 03:54.169
Will we abandon the tactical progress
bought by tens of thousands of sacrifices,

03:54.170 --> 03:55.960
just to serve ourselves
up on a silver platter?

03:57.080 --> 04:00.820
I know we have to fight...

04:01.420 --> 04:06.260
But not everyone's as eager to die as you are.

04:12.080 --> 04:14.560
I hope you won't get upset when I say this...

04:15.230 --> 04:17.570
But you aren't a strong person, Jean.

04:17.790 --> 04:20.070
So you can relate to the feelings of the weak.

04:20.810 --> 04:25.629
What's more, you excel at
sizing up any situation.

04:25.630 --> 04:28.810
Isn't that why you already
know what needs to be done?

04:36.050 --> 04:39.200
What needs to be done...

04:40.760 --> 04:42.880
Hey, guys...

04:46.000 --> 04:50.130
Have you decided which force you're joining?

04:51.380 --> 04:53.020
I've made up my mind..

04:54.020 --> 04:55.100
I...

04:56.340 --> 04:57.640
I...

04:59.150 --> 05:00.940
I'm joining the Recon Corps!

05:11.830 --> 05:12.700
Damn it.

05:13.180 --> 05:16.359
Hey, Annie. What do you think?

05:16.360 --> 05:18.979
Even Jean said he's joining the Recon Corps.

05:18.980 --> 05:20.789
Huh? Jean said that?

05:20.790 --> 05:21.710
I have no opinion.

05:22.060 --> 05:24.619
You're joining the Military Police, right?

05:24.620 --> 05:27.220
Maybe I should too.

05:28.400 --> 05:32.659
If someone told you to die, would you do it?

05:32.660 --> 05:35.459
What? Of course not.

05:35.460 --> 05:38.730
Then why not make your own decision?

05:40.100 --> 05:42.950
Armin, what about you?

05:43.690 --> 05:44.740
I...

05:45.020 --> 05:47.859
I think if you know why you have to die,

05:47.860 --> 05:50.490
there are times when you
must lay down your life.

05:50.820 --> 05:52.519
Not that I want to die.

05:52.520 --> 05:54.799
I see. You've made your choice.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.750
Yeah.

05:56.060 --> 05:59.019
I've been thinking it over
for quite a long time.

05:59.020 --> 06:01.470
Seriously? Armin, you too?

06:03.180 --> 06:06.260
You're weak, but you've got guts.

06:06.510 --> 06:08.760
Th-Thank you.

06:09.340 --> 06:13.200
Annie, you're actually
pretty nice, aren't you?

06:14.080 --> 06:18.520
It seems like you don't want
us to join the Recon Corps.

06:18.820 --> 06:22.900
Do you have a reason you want
to join the Military Police?

06:23.510 --> 06:24.880
Not really.

06:26.130 --> 06:27.820
It's just...

06:28.730 --> 06:31.280
I want to survive.

06:38.500 --> 06:42.199
It looks like they couldn't
find any soldiers who used

06:42.200 --> 06:44.199
their Maneuver Gear without permission.

06:44.200 --> 06:45.479
Then who did it?

06:45.480 --> 06:47.019
No idea...

06:47.020 --> 06:50.180
Right now, I'm more worried about
the upcoming induction ceremony.

06:50.740 --> 06:54.660
How many of the new cadets are
actually crazy enough to join us?

06:55.460 --> 06:56.959
Hey, Eren.

06:56.960 --> 07:00.369
Are there any people in
your class who'd join us?

07:00.370 --> 07:01.270
There are some.

07:02.720 --> 07:05.090
No, there were some.

07:05.940 --> 07:08.020
I don't know about now.

07:09.050 --> 07:10.360
Attention!

07:14.080 --> 07:15.399
Get ready.

07:15.400 --> 07:16.400
We're going out on patrol.

07:16.401 --> 07:17.629
Yes, sir!

07:17.630 --> 07:19.989
Good morning, Captain Levi!

07:19.990 --> 07:21.179
Listen, Eren...

07:21.180 --> 07:23.469
Never stray more than two
horse-lengths from me.

07:23.470 --> 07:25.229
Don't forget that the only reason

07:25.230 --> 07:27.859
you're not locked up is
because I'm watching you.

07:27.860 --> 07:28.850
Yes, sir!

07:28.850 --> 07:29.820
Let's go.

08:00.080 --> 08:01.180
Jean...

08:01.880 --> 08:04.289
You're really joining the Recon Corps?

08:04.290 --> 08:04.880
Yeah.

08:05.080 --> 08:06.959
Why the sudden choice?

08:06.960 --> 08:10.059
I mean... Aren't you scared?

08:10.060 --> 08:10.690
Huh?

08:10.691 --> 08:13.269
Of course I don't want
 to join the Recon Corps.

08:13.270 --> 08:15.559
Th-Then why...

08:15.560 --> 08:19.719
It's not that the Titans don't
scare me anymore either.

08:19.720 --> 08:26.379
And I won't spout nonsense like, "The
best belong in the Recon Corps."

08:26.380 --> 08:28.680
I'm not as eager to die as some are.

08:29.170 --> 08:30.150
You mean Eren?

08:31.060 --> 08:34.519
He's already joined the Recon Corps.

08:34.520 --> 08:36.949
Trainees, line up!

08:36.950 --> 08:38.660
Line up in front of the stage!

08:38.850 --> 08:39.989
Line up in front of the stage!

08:39.990 --> 08:44.960
I'm not risking my life
because someone convinced me.

08:45.880 --> 08:50.660
This is a job you can't do
unless you decide for yourself.

08:58.740 --> 09:03.270
I am Erwin Smith, Commander
of the Recon Corps.

09:03.940 --> 09:06.859
Today, you will choose a
branch of the military.

09:06.860 --> 09:11.530
Putting it bluntly, I'm here to
persuade you to join the Recon Corps.

09:11.930 --> 09:14.539
During their recent attack,

09:14.540 --> 09:17.360
you learned how terrifying the Titans can be,

09:17.620 --> 09:21.339
as well as how limited your own strength is.

09:21.340 --> 09:22.120
However...

09:22.890 --> 09:24.849
That battle brought mankind

09:24.850 --> 09:27.680
closer to victory than ever before.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.380
Eren Jaeger's existence is crucial.

09:31.680 --> 09:35.299
By risking his own life,

09:35.300 --> 09:38.160
he's undoubtedly proven himself
a great ally to mankind.

09:40.440 --> 09:46.259
With his help, not only did
we stop the Titans' advance,

09:46.260 --> 09:49.360
but we've also obtained a key to
discovering their true nature.

09:55.140 --> 09:58.609
We believe that the basement
of his old home in Shiganshina

09:58.610 --> 10:01.300
holds answers about the Titans
that even he doesn't know.

10:01.840 --> 10:04.620
If we can reach that basement,

10:04.910 --> 10:11.710
we will find clues to ending this
century of Titan domination.

10:13.180 --> 10:14.710
The basement?

10:15.570 --> 10:18.139
We've already advanced that far?

10:18.140 --> 10:21.100
If we learn what they are, we can end this!

10:22.060 --> 10:24.909
No matter how much he needs recruits,

10:24.910 --> 10:27.959
I can't believe he's
publicizing this information.

10:27.960 --> 10:31.389
Or does he have some hidden motive?

10:31.390 --> 10:35.550
What is he trying to do?

10:49.780 --> 10:53.320
We will head for the
basement in Shiganshina.

10:54.250 --> 10:58.300
However, that requires
us to retake Wall Maria.

10:58.300 --> 11:01.390
In other words, our
objective remains the same.

11:02.480 --> 11:06.320
But with the Trost gate sealed for good,

11:06.320 --> 11:09.290
we'll have to take the long way
around from Karanes in the east.

11:10.570 --> 11:13.880
The four years we spent laying a route

11:13.880 --> 11:15.940
for a full-scale
army have gone to waste.

11:18.170 --> 11:21.980
In those four years, more than sixty
percent of the Recon Corps lost their lives.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.540
Sixty percent in four years...

11:25.300 --> 11:27.520
An insane figure.

11:29.700 --> 11:34.590
Any trainees who join us will participate
in our excursion beyond the walls next month.

11:35.060 --> 11:38.260
We expect thirty percent won't return.

11:38.680 --> 11:41.650
In four years, most will be dead.

11:41.650 --> 11:44.550
But those who make it through

11:44.550 --> 11:47.690
will become superior soldiers
with a high survival rate.

11:52.310 --> 11:54.280
Now you know the discouraging facts.

11:54.960 --> 11:59.280
Any of you still willing to
risk your lives, remain here.

12:00.180 --> 12:02.290
Ask yourselves:

12:02.290 --> 12:07.000
Are you willing to offer your
beating hearts for mankind?

12:12.400 --> 12:13.400
That is all.

12:13.980 --> 12:16.550
Anyone who wishes to join
another branch is dismissed.

12:19.080 --> 12:19.930
Commander...

12:20.380 --> 12:22.930
Don't you think you scared them a little much?

12:23.360 --> 12:25.190
All of them will leave!

12:50.400 --> 12:51.580
Damn it...

12:52.090 --> 12:54.760
Come on, you've already made your choice!

12:55.430 --> 12:58.760
Don't give me more reasons to hate myself...

12:59.620 --> 13:03.770
If I don't leave now, I'll
have to face them again.

13:04.950 --> 13:08.730
I left the village to join
the Military Police...

13:09.880 --> 13:11.860
My mom would be so happy.

13:11.860 --> 13:15.690
If I join the Military Police, the whole
village would think better of me.

13:16.500 --> 13:18.660
We all know...

13:19.450 --> 13:21.370
We've already seen it...

13:21.830 --> 13:23.830
How the Titans...

13:24.600 --> 13:26.330
devour humans!

13:51.430 --> 13:56.200
Are you all willing to die
if you're ordered to?

13:56.200 --> 13:57.780
I don't want to die!

13:59.260 --> 14:00.850
I see.

14:00.850 --> 14:02.740
I like the looks on your faces.

14:04.680 --> 14:10.040
I hereby welcome all of
you to the Recon Corps!

14:10.280 --> 14:12.820
This is a true salute!

14:12.820 --> 14:14.590
Offer up your hearts!

14:16.000 --> 14:17.040
Yes, sir!

14:20.440 --> 14:21.960
Guys...

14:22.570 --> 14:24.100
This is the pits.

14:24.100 --> 14:25.680
The Recon Corps...

14:26.340 --> 14:27.980
I'm scared!

14:27.980 --> 14:29.460
I want to go home.

14:29.460 --> 14:31.950
I don't even care.

14:35.740 --> 14:38.690
If you were going to cry,
you should have left.

14:40.340 --> 14:42.960
You've done well to endure your fear.

14:42.960 --> 14:45.200
You are brave soldiers.

14:45.920 --> 14:47.990
You have my heartfelt respect.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.280
Salute!

14:58.870 --> 15:00.800
I'm Squad Leader Ness.

15:01.020 --> 15:03.410
And this is Shallot, my horse.

15:03.410 --> 15:06.230
She loves to chew on people's hair,

15:06.230 --> 15:08.380
so be careful or you'll
wind up prematurely bald.

15:08.380 --> 15:09.680
Nice to meet you all!

15:09.680 --> 15:12.980
Hey! S-Stop it, Shallot!

15:12.980 --> 15:15.360
Someone grab her!

15:15.360 --> 15:16.980
Our training began the next day.

15:17.750 --> 15:21.260
Instead of practical training,
it was mostly memorizing the

15:21.260 --> 15:24.990
long-range scouting formation
Commander Erwin had devised.

15:25.940 --> 15:27.550
Strangely,

15:27.550 --> 15:29.830
although the formation was
written out in precise detail,

15:29.830 --> 15:34.520
Eren Jaeger's position
was nowhere to be found.

15:34.520 --> 15:36.680
You new recruits will be here,

15:36.680 --> 15:38.240
in between the recon support team

15:38.240 --> 15:39.960
and the supply wagon escort team.

15:40.300 --> 15:44.470
Your jobs will be to ride alongside the
spare horses and relay messages.

15:44.870 --> 15:47.720
The Special Operations Squad will be here,

15:48.050 --> 15:50.290
standing by in the center of the last ranks.

15:50.290 --> 15:51.980
We're pretty far back.

15:52.440 --> 15:55.380
It's the safest place in the formation.

15:55.380 --> 15:59.090
We're even more heavily guarded
than the supply wagons.

15:59.090 --> 16:02.840
Our goal this time is just
to sortie and return safely.

16:02.840 --> 16:05.490
This expedition is so brief

16:05.770 --> 16:09.720
because it's a practice run for
your journey to Shiganshina.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.800
Um...

16:11.800 --> 16:16.920
I still don't know what this
power should be used for...

16:16.920 --> 16:21.130
Did you understand what the
Commander's question meant?

16:22.350 --> 16:23.880
Where do you think the enemy is?

16:24.480 --> 16:26.900
Did you all understand?

16:26.900 --> 16:28.050
Nope.

16:28.720 --> 16:32.400
It would be an overstatement
to say I understand it all.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.130
But I think...

16:33.130 --> 16:37.350
It's possible this mission has another goal,

16:37.350 --> 16:42.150
but the Commander has decided it'd be
best not to reveal that objective.

16:42.150 --> 16:46.490
So we should just focus on
getting there and back.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.880
Just believe in the Commander.

16:48.880 --> 16:49.800
Right...

16:50.280 --> 16:52.180
That's all the training for today.

16:52.180 --> 16:53.520
Prepare to return to base.

17:08.400 --> 17:10.570
Th-That's...

17:10.570 --> 17:13.850
Sir, may I go talk with my classmates?

17:13.850 --> 17:15.960
Go right ahead.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.960
Hey, Mikasa! Armin!

17:19.080 --> 17:19.980
Eren!

17:20.340 --> 17:22.850
It feels like it's been forever!

17:22.850 --> 17:26.300
Eren, did they do anything bad to you?

17:26.300 --> 17:28.490
Did they examine you all over?

17:28.490 --> 17:31.280
Did they psychologically torture you?

17:31.280 --> 17:33.580
Nothing like that.

17:33.580 --> 17:36.000
That midget bastard crossed the line.

17:36.000 --> 17:38.060
Someday, I'll make him pay for it.

17:38.060 --> 17:40.540
You don't mean Captain Levi, do you?

17:41.310 --> 17:42.750
Yo, Eren...

17:42.750 --> 17:43.800
It's been so long!

17:44.300 --> 17:47.250
What? Everyone's here?

17:48.180 --> 17:52.140
But if you're all here, then...

17:52.140 --> 17:54.180
Doesn't that mean all of you
joined the Recon Corps?

17:54.180 --> 17:56.760
Why else would we be here?

17:56.760 --> 18:01.830
So only Jean, Annie, and Marco
joined the Military Police?

18:05.020 --> 18:08.040
No way. Not you too!

18:08.040 --> 18:09.700
Marco's dead.

18:10.790 --> 18:13.170
What was that?

18:14.040 --> 18:16.950
Did you say Marco's dead?

18:17.980 --> 18:22.040
Not everyone goes out in a blaze of glory.

18:22.040 --> 18:24.460
I don't even know how it happened.

18:25.550 --> 18:30.100
He died without anyone around.

18:30.100 --> 18:31.410
Marco...

18:34.240 --> 18:36.970
Hey, newbies! Get over here!

18:37.380 --> 18:39.520
Your uniforms are here!

19:17.970 --> 19:20.640
Are you really...

19:20.640 --> 19:24.520
Yes, we'll all be participating
in the mission too.

19:24.520 --> 19:25.800
Hey, Eren.

19:25.800 --> 19:30.190
I heard that when you turned into a
Titan, you tried to kill Mikasa.

19:30.190 --> 19:31.650
What does that mean?

19:32.350 --> 19:35.080
No. Eren was trying to hit a fly...

19:35.080 --> 19:36.740
I wasn't asking you.

19:38.160 --> 19:42.030
Mikasa, that wound on your
cheek looks pretty bad.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.370
When did you get that?

19:47.450 --> 19:49.220
I'm told it's true...

19:49.220 --> 19:52.360
When I became a Titan, I tried to kill Mikasa.

19:52.360 --> 19:55.520
So then you don't remember it, right?

19:55.520 --> 19:59.140
In other words, you didn't even
know you had this Titan power,

19:59.510 --> 20:02.940
and you still don't have
the means to control it.

20:02.940 --> 20:04.890
Yeah, that's right.

20:08.900 --> 20:10.560
Did you all hear that?

20:10.560 --> 20:12.660
That's the situation.

20:12.660 --> 20:15.320
Mankind's existence, and
our lives, depend on him.

20:15.880 --> 20:18.000
We'll probably die just like Marco,

20:18.000 --> 20:20.330
without Eren even noticing.

20:20.640 --> 20:24.580
Jean, what's the point in asking
Eren these questions now?

20:25.450 --> 20:27.660
Listen, Mikasa.

20:27.660 --> 20:30.320
Not everyone's like you,

20:30.320 --> 20:33.010
willing to die for Eren's
sake and nothing more.

20:34.210 --> 20:40.420
We deserve to know what we're dying for.

20:40.420 --> 20:43.520
Otherwise, we'll hesitate when the time comes.

20:43.950 --> 20:47.310
We want something in return from him.

20:48.140 --> 20:50.520
Let's see what he has to offer us.

20:51.460 --> 20:55.390
And whether it's worth our lives.

20:59.700 --> 21:01.200
So, Eren...

21:02.260 --> 21:06.460
We're really counting on you.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.470
Yeah.

21:15.990 --> 21:17.970
Sir, it's almost time.

21:19.880 --> 21:22.470
We've driven all the Titans out of the area.

21:22.770 --> 21:24.890
Thirty seconds until we open the gate!

21:32.040 --> 21:33.610
It's the Recon Corps!

21:33.610 --> 21:37.070
They call that emblem on their
backs the Wings of Freedom!

21:37.240 --> 21:38.760
So cool...

21:40.060 --> 21:41.700
It's time!

21:42.180 --> 21:45.580
Humanity will take another step forward.

21:46.070 --> 21:49.170
Show me what you can do!

21:50.920 --> 21:52.920
Open the gate!

22:05.390 --> 22:07.460
Advance!

22:11.790 --> 22:15.110
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

22:16.030 --> 22:18.570
Onward!

22:36.200 --> 22:41.590
If we suppose that I am not me,

22:41.590 --> 22:46.130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

22:46.780 --> 22:51.660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

22:51.660 --> 22:56.810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

22:57.090 --> 23:02.020
I could hear someone calling

23:02.310 --> 23:05.920
But now my ears are just ringing

23:06.240 --> 23:11.080
It's as if time has frozen

23:11.380 --> 23:13.990
Now, wake up

23:13.990 --> 23:18.960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

23:19.510 --> 23:24.260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

23:24.670 --> 23:28.830
I felt like a living corpse

23:29.240 --> 23:33.960
We break out of our walls

23:34.270 --> 23:40.350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

23:53.777 --> 23:55.910
Assembling into the long-distance scouting formation,

23:56.511 --> 23:58.955
the Recon Corps mobilized past the walls.

